sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Authenticated user
  participant A as FastAPI health route
  participant Q as Qdrant
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  participant L as Optional LLM
  U->>A: question + optional metadata filters
  A->>A: derive owner only from verified JWT
  A->>Q: vector query with mandatory owner/model filters
  Q-->>A: candidate chunk IDs only
  A->>D: lexical query + owner/document/generation/state filters
  A->>D: re-resolve vector IDs under identical authorization predicates
  D-->>A: authorized chunk text + document metadata
  A->>A: hybrid rank, bound context, build citations/evidence
  A->>L: question + authorized evidence only (if enabled)
  L-->>A: generated text
  A->>D: save owner-scoped chat history
  A-->>U: answer, evidence, citations, generation status
